{"id":"cacbafc4-229f-48c1-a57d-182cfabca423","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:19:34.134Z","batchId":"settings_gpt-6-luna_high","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <p class=\"small muted\">ACCOUNT</p>\n      <h1>Account settings</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Personal account</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-heading\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"profile-heading\">Profile</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Update the information associated with your account.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-settings-form>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Jordan Lee\">JL</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <strong>Profile photo</strong>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Your initials are shown when you haven’t added a photo.</p>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Upload photo</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Remove</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Full name</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"full-name\" value=\"Jordan Lee\" autocomplete=\"name\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Username</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"username\" value=\"jordanlee\" autocomplete=\"username\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Email address</span>\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" value=\"jordan.lee@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Phone number</span>\n          <input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" value=\"+1 415 555 0138\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Language</span>\n          <select name=\"language\">\n            <option selected>English (US)</option>\n            <option>English (UK)</option>\n            <option>Español</option>\n            <option>Français</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Time zone</span>\n          <select name=\"timezone\">\n            <option selected>Pacific Time (UTC−08:00)</option>\n            <option>Mountain Time (UTC−07:00)</option>\n            <option>Central Time (UTC−06:00)</option>\n            <option>Eastern Time (UTC−05:00)</option>\n            <option>Coordinated Universal Time (UTC+00:00)</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-save-status></p>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"submit\">Save profile</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"notifications-heading\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"notifications-heading\">Notifications</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which updates you receive and where they’re sent.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-settings-form>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Email notifications</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Product updates</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">New features, improvements, and occasional announcements.</p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"product-updates\" checked>\n            <span>On</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Weekly digest</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">A weekly summary of activity and updates you may have missed.</p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"weekly-digest\">\n            <span>On</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Security alerts</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Important notices about sign-ins and changes to your account.</p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"security-alerts\" checked disabled>\n            <span>Always on</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">In-app notifications</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Replies and mentions</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Get notified when someone replies to you or mentions you.</p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"replies-mentions\" checked>\n            <span>On</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Reminders</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Receive reminders for items you’ve saved or scheduled.</p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reminders\" checked>\n            <span>On</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-save-status></p>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"submit\">Save preferences</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-heading\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"privacy-heading\">Privacy</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Control what others can see and how your account information is used.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-settings-form>\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Profile visibility</span>\n        <select name=\"profile-visibility\">\n          <option selected>Public</option>\n          <option>People I follow</option>\n          <option>Private</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Choose who can view your profile and public activity.</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n        <div>\n          <strong>Search engine visibility</strong>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Allow search engines to show your public profile in results.</p>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"search-visibility\" checked>\n          <span>On</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n        <div>\n          <strong>Activity status</strong>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Let people you interact with see when you’re active.</p>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"activity-status\">\n          <span>On</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n        <div>\n          <strong>Personalized recommendations</strong>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Use your activity to tailor suggestions and recommendations.</p>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"personalized-recommendations\" checked>\n          <span>On</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n        <div>\n          <strong>Download your information</strong>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Request a copy of the information associated with your account.</p>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Request a copy</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between row gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-save-status></p>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"submit\">Save privacy settings</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-settings-form]\").forEach(function (form) {\n    form.addEventListener(\"submit\", function (event) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      var status = form.querySelector(\"[data-save-status]\");\n      if (status) status.textContent = \"Changes saved for this session.\";\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[26693,"<"],[26702,"main"],[26702," class"],[26706,"=\""],[26708,"page"],[26711," stack"],[26721," gap"],[26724,"-lg"],[26728,"\">\n"],[26732," "],[26734," <"],[26741,"header"],[26743," class"],[26747,"=\""],[26750,"between"],[26752," row"],[26758," gap"],[26768,"-lg"],[26774,"\">\n"],[26778,"   "],[26781," <